id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"xHRxPN0DxsrLD-7XqrKvcQ","review_id":"kERbbnHL7dyXCWXMMrschQ","date":"2015-11-26T00:28:25","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9234623312950134,"text_excerpt":"Another cool place that we ran across during the lots of time that we spent around Frenchman Street. We were told when we sat at the bar that the place was a really late night spot, so it wouldn't be too crowded for a while. This news was very welcoming for us, as we wanted to just chill for a bit in a low key place. The drinks are simple...nothing too fancy...but are strong and cheap. The bartender was very nice to talk to as well. We really enjoyed the local bluegrass type band that was playing as well. I like that they have a big courtyard out back as well. We will definitely be checking this place out again on our next trip...maybe a bit later when it's hopping!"},{"business_id":"xHRxPN0DxsrLD-7XqrKvcQ","review_id":"N3lDGGKK2fqvfyYRbMk1sQ","date":"2017-06-30T12:34:51","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9180502891540527,"text_excerpt":"The reviews for this establishment seem to be telling me to not eat the food so I'm glad that I didn't. (Even though the menu was looking pretty good.) Dragon's Den is definitely gonna be on my list of places to party for my next visit to NOLA. There is no cover! The vibe was very welcoming and the music selection and variety was some of the best that I've heard. I was here on Wednesday night which seemed to be reggae night. Reggae and afro-beat upstairs and hip-hop/rap downstairs. I also loved that the downstairs had a hype man, which may have been necessary because it was definitely hard not to have people ready to float upstairs. This bar is also pretty spacious. Besides upstairs and d..."},{"business_id":"xHRxPN0DxsrLD-7XqrKvcQ","review_id":"t8pV1HhgrGrGiQtJtPZXrw","date":"2011-02-11T21:53:02","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9177337884902954,"text_excerpt":"I've been here twice, once for reggae night with DJ T-Roy and once for turntablist Rob Swift. I like the venue and style of the place because I'm an \"asiaphile\" and I like all things dragons. Some may consider this place a \"dive bar\" compared to other places in the city but I like it, Dragon's Den definitely has character with cheap drinks and great music."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"xHRxPN0DxsrLD-7XqrKvcQ","photo_id":"FRKBQdWpv8rx0E_uBG0TTg","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/FRKBQdWpv8rx0E_uBG0TTg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8387095928192139},{"business_id":"xHRxPN0DxsrLD-7XqrKvcQ","photo_id":"WCIAmg1YPNB9Smt9OID4cw","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/WCIAmg1YPNB9Smt9OID4cw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8267419338226318},{"business_id":"xHRxPN0DxsrLD-7XqrKvcQ","photo_id":"-Rn60hduffcb-2n50RyOtg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/-Rn60hduffcb-2n50RyOtg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7944424152374268},{"business_id":"xHRxPN0DxsrLD-7XqrKvcQ","photo_id":"ilpBiF_DqQ59sxzPGcDK5Q","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/ilpBiF_DqQ59sxzPGcDK5Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7451852560043335},{"business_id":"xHRxPN0DxsrLD-7XqrKvcQ","photo_id":"O-zIFGuE7rhSe_x4tFN2IA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/O-z